{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average weight of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> boys is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/e/f5e10e5f3aa7c766cb27c3ad319fa526f71588cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> pounds and the average weight of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> girls is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> pounds.  The average weight of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> children is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b6b52dcfb1908a6f4bf196f755e365d49728f3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 135\\text{ pounds} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 137\\text{ pounds} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 138\\text{ pounds} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 140\\text{ pounds} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 141\\text{ pounds}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"709\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The total weight of the boys is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c244b124b6899bf1614d9a179d1d94e57bcaa331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 150 = 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" /> pounds, and the total weight of the girls is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/4/55481e88686f46bcf66c281e387791e756ae8554.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 120 = 480$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" /> pounds.  Therefore, the total weight of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> children is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/2127d5fa0d39edd4dc3eee6fd20b889b56d8d0ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$900 + 480 = 1380$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" /> pounds, and their average weight is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7b69ca89b8bcf1f73c2647587fc2a7691f3122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1380 \\div 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 138}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"176\" height=\"30\" /> pounds.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/i